\item[S2] John Cowles and Ruben Gamboa, \emph{Perfect Numbers in ACL2}, EPTCS 192 (2015), 53--59, DOI 10.4204/EPTCS.192.5; arXiv:1509.06081v1, Sections 1--2, the unrestricted infinitude question and $\sigma(n)=2n$ definition. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1509.06081v1}.
